(4. Photon QNS1 1.3) Tj
0 -11 Td
(Magic QNS1. Version 1.3. Canonical JSON \(sorted keys, tight separators\). Body hash) Tj
0 -11 Td
(h is SHA-256 of the frame with h omitted. Fact hash fh is SHA-256 of the clipped) Tj
0 -11 Td
(fact \(?160\). QNM and AZPIPE already cite fh. Remote body does not enter STM.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
