0 -11 Td
(via is hop-only \(AIH-WP-1.3\). Any currently enabled declared bearer may carry the) Tj
0 -11 Td
(next hop. The pair does not store a required medium. Wi-Fi dying is path gone,) Tj
0 -11 Td
(bind remains.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(hop.max default 8. seen is a hash list. Loops drop. Over-length paths drop.) Tj
0 -11 Td
(pull stays false. bridges=2. isolate=true on poison / tamper.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(inner is the AZPIPE-admitted folded body, or null on a refuse envelope. Refuse) Tj
0 -11 Td
(envelopes stop at the hop that closed. They do not carry inner into memory.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(5. Same laws locally) Tj
0 -11 Td
(Inbound hop list \(AP-WP-0.2\), on qnsd:) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(    frag ? sweep ? fold ? static ? fold ? entry ? frag ? via) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(frag. DecisionGATE flags. Empty or ungrounded inbound refuses before SweepGate) Tj
0 -11 Td
(spends work.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(sweep. SweepGate airlock \(SG-WP-0.1\). Poison, malware-class marks, block-keys,) Tj
0 -11 Td
(off-origin when inbound and untrusted. Isolate and refuse. Do not merge.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(fold / static. fld3-wire until foldlock.py sits beside the hop. Freeze hashes the) Tj
0 -11 Td
(folded bytes. Second fold after canonicalization.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(entry. ChainLock stamp \(CL-WP-0.4\). Fact-bearing card. Hash-only cards refuse.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(via. Emit only along an existing pair edge, APG pass, hop bearer enabled, hop_max) Tj
0 -11 Td
(respected, node not isolated / PHOENIX-LOCK / scorched.) Tj
0 -11 Td
( ) Tj
0 -11 Td
(APG \(qnm-node\): clean pass; reanswer-without-cite refuse; flood refuse; unknown) Tj
0 -11 Td
(slug or stub-as-live refuse; credential/login/cookie refuse; poison/tamper isolate) Tj
0 -11 Td
(+ spend ID + drop tethers. Poison is refused, not interpreted.) Tj
0 -11 Td
